Honestly, minimal makeup it’s all I’ve been wearing lately and it’s pretty much what I always have wore before. I only started doing different looks because of Instagram and as much as I like trying new things, I always believe minimal makeup is my jam and I feel the most beautiful like this, also, it has taken me a long time to finally feel beautiful again.
Mom life is real and we truly forget about ourselves but I am on a mission to feel beautiful again.
If you are reading this, I hope that you can remind yourself of how beautiful YOU are today and everyday ❤️
