Happy Mercury Retrograde 💭 a lot of people perceive the retrograde as something negative but it’s all about perspective. It’s a time for reflection- to think about the way we are communicating with others as well as ourselves. It’s a time to re-evaluate where we are putting our energy. It’s important to be conscious of how we are speaking and thinking to ourselves. Let it out, let it flow- just breathe. You can’t stop time but you can still plan ahead to ensure preparation. Refresh, relax, rejuvenate. 
One of my favorite crystals to carry is Rose Quartz- it is the stone of love. It emanates compassion, nurturing, and harmonizing energies. It always makes me feel more balanced with my inner being- what’s your favorite crystal?
