My skincare routine has chainged a bit lately, when i started noticing that my super dry skin is nowadays more like combination/dry!
It needs hydration but also my T-zone gets oily and that has NEVER happened before😂
I noticed a huge difference in my skin condition when i started to use more skincare targeted to combination/dry skin🔥

