💛 imitation is the sincerest form of flattery💛
SWIPE TO SEE
So here’s one technique I’m NOT good at, cut crease. It seems like in the beauty world, if you can’t do a cut crease then you don’t know makeup at all.
Ask yourself, how many times have you seen people in real like sporting a cut crease? 🤔
It doesn’t look flattering on everyone (I personally hate how it looks on me) and most of all, it isn’t something everyone should know how to do.
That being said, here’s my best shot at it so far. My friend @ajrod0426 inspired me to try this while I was watching one of her Facebook lives. She made it look so easy (spoiler alert: it wasn’t LOL) but that spark right there is what I aim to be. I aim to inspire ppl to at least try something new, out of their comfort zone, as simplified as possible.
Editing this tutorial right now, should be up on my channel tomorrow 🤞🏻
