#ad @RandomHouse // I’m tired, y’all. Everything that’s happening in our country, the race stuff, it’s starting to get to me. I find myself checking every move I make, every word I say to make sure I’m not doing something that could get me hurt or killed. It’s exhausting. The only way it’ll change is if people who aren’t like me begin to understand what it’s like for Black women in this country. Black women, mothers, folks who are trying to take care of our family...just like you. 
@JodiPicoult’s book, Small Great Things is heartbreaking in so many ways to me. The story resonated with me. I saw myself in some of the depictions of the main character, Ruth Jefferson, and it brought me to tears. It’s an important read, though. 
If you’ve already read it, tell me what you think. If you haven’t read it yet, check out the link in my bio and then please come back and tell me your thoughts. #ReadReflectConnect #SmallGreatThings

